- Fetching endpoints...
  twin-check active  v5  $0.03 USDC  0 reqs  $0 earned
    Copycat / twin token detector. Give a ticker and get every DEX-traded token using it, ranked by liquidity, volume, trades, age and socials, with the likely original and a confidence level. Optionally pass the address you were given to learn if it is the likely original or a likely copycat. Use before buying any token found by ticker, especially fresh launches on Robinhood Chain and Base.
  token-check active  v5  $0.01 USDC  1 reqs  $0.01 earned
    Pre-trade token safety check for Base, Solana, Robinhood Chain and major EVM chains. One call returns a verdict (OK / CAUTION / DANGER), a 0-100 risk score and ranked flags: honeypot, sell/buy tax, owner privileges, mint and freeze authority, creator honeypot history, holder concentration, LP lock, liquidity and pair age, plus the largest sell that stays under 1/2/5% price impact. On Robinhood Chain Uniswap v4 pools it also reads the pool's hook and simulates a real buy and sell on the live pool (nothing is sent), so honeypots and fee-skimming hooks are measured, not guessed. Call before any swap or buy.
  momentum active  v5  $0.005 USDC  0 reqs  $0 earned
    Short-term momentum read for any DEX-traded token: signal (STRONG_UP … STRONG_DOWN), -100..100 score, price change m5/h1/h6/h24, buy/sell flow ratio, volume acceleration, liquidity-to-market-cap and manipulation warnings. Use for entry and exit timing.
  exit-check active  v3  $0.01 USDC  0 reqs  $0 earned
    Can I get out? Position-sizing and exit check for any DEX-traded token on Base, Solana, Robinhood Chain and major EVM chains. Give a token and a USD size and get estimated price impact, sell tax, total exit cost, expected proceeds, share of 24h volume, an exitability rating (EASY / OK / COSTLY / HARD / TRAPPED) and the largest single sell that stays under 1, 2 and 5% impact. Flags tokens whose contract blocks selling; on Robinhood Chain v4 pools it simulates a real buy and sell on the live pool and reports the measured round-trip cost. Use before entering a position or when planning an exit.
  batch-check active  v5  $0.05 USDC  0 reqs  $0 earned
    Safety-rank up to 10 tokens in one call. Returns each token's verdict, risk score and top flags, sorted safest first. Built for agents screening a watchlist, trending list or new launches before trading.
